<attribute name="briefOutline" nodeId="d84460a8">&lt;p&gt;
    Topics typically covered in this artifact include: 
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        In-scope and out-of-scope functional requirements
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Context to understand business needs for functional requirements
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        To-be state that describes functional requirements and features
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        System use cases and scenarios
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Risks and downstream dependencies
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Gaps identified during workshops&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
